{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"练习清单","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：练习清单。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"1. 实现冒泡/选择/插入/归并/快排各一遍，对拍验证。\n2. 用并查集做 Kruskal 最小生成树。\n3. 用 DFS 判图是否有环。\n4. 写 LCS 并输出具体子序列。\n5. 把 0-1 背包改成二维 dp 再优化到一维。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「练习清单」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"练习清单","slug":"senior-algorithms-topic-13","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「练习清单」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":26,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-013-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"634922d6d45d9e0e67e245a5927a1777795206cc061df7dc56091c479deaa83b","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/634922d6d45d9e0e/02-算法竞赛入门经典.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"练习清单"},"content_hash":"cfef0f69244fb66f48372fc147d2b5fe95cfe355e341c8a9b397d3398f8f2267","course":{"slug":"senior-algorithms","title":"算法竞赛入门","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
